      "generator": "built-in image_gen",
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Production sprite animation expansion for original hand-drawn 2D dark fantasy insect game. Reference images are identity and style references only, NOT desired grid or background. Preserve exact character identity, proportions, costume, palette, clean ink and painterly material textures. Pure side view all living frames facing RIGHT. Transparent real alpha background, no backdrop, ground, shadows, labels, text, borders, particles, panels. Each equal cell contains exactly one COMPLETE character including every antenna, blade and robe, with ample transparent gutter. Fixed body scale and centered pelvis, grounded foot baseline at 90% cell height. Distinct redrawn poses with real limb and weapon articulation, never stamp, shift or rotate a whole copy. Character: Crimson Scissor Apostle as refs, cockroach priest wine-red ragged robes, needle crown bronze armor, huge hinged scissors; complete open blades and long antennae. Exactly FOUR COLUMNS by SIX ROWS, 24 full body sprites. VERY SMALL characters each only 65% of cell width and height, at least 15% blank margin each side; leave truly empty space between all 24. All are same scale. Each row four sequential hand-drawn key poses: ROW1 heavy_windup: opening scissors and lifting above head, body coils. ROW2 heavy: overhead scissor chop, closed blades down through impact and recovery. ROW3 cast_windup: claw draws crimson silk threads inward, scissors low. ROW4 cast: arm sweeps releases attached crimson thread loop toward right then withdraws. ROW5 phase_windup: lowered crouch with scissors crossed and rising recoil. ROW6 phase: turns shoulders forward in great scissors lunge and opens cloak, returns guard. No camera facing changes, every living frame side view right. Do not copy original 4x3 layout; create 4x6 new poses on transparent background. No floor, no shadows, no text.",
